  <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><div class="container"><a href="/index.html">Home</a> <span class="sep">/</span> <a href="/tours.html">Tours</a> <span class="sep">/</span> <span>9 Days Luxury Silk Road: Xi'an to Urumqi</span></div></nav>

<div class="tour-detail-hero" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg')">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>9 Days Luxury Silk Road: Xi'an to Urumqi</h1>
    <div class="route">📍 Xi'an → Dunhuang → Turpan → Urumqi</div>
    <div class="badge-row"><span>⭐ 5-Star</span><span>🍷 VIP Access</span><span>🎓 Private Guide</span><span>🚄 High-Speed Train</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="tour-detail-layout">
  <div class="tour-detail-main reveal">
    <h2>Tour Overview</h2>
    <p>Experience the Silk Road in unparalleled luxury on this 9-day journey from Xi'an to Urumqi. Stay in carefully selected 5-star hotels, enjoy VIP access at major attractions, and travel with your own private English-speaking guide. From the Terracotta Warriors in Xi'an to the Mogao Caves in Dunhuang and the ancient oasis of Turpan, this exclusive tour combines the Silk Road's greatest treasures with the comfort and refinement reserved for discerning travelers.</p>

    <div class="highlight-box"><h3>Trip Highlights</h3><ul>
      <li>VIP entry to the Terracotta Warriors Museum</li><li>Private viewing of the Mogao Caves with an expert archaeologist</li><li>Exclusive camel ride at the Singing Sand Dunes</li><li>Sunset champagne at Crescent Moon Spring</li><li>Private tour of the Jiaohe Ancient Ruins</li><li>Behind-the-scenes visit to a traditional Uyghur silk workshop</li><li>Gourmet dining at award-winning restaurants</li><li>Luxury high-speed train in business class</li>
    </ul></div>

    <h2>Day-by-Day Itinerary</h2>
    <ul class="itinerary">
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>1</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Arrive in Xi'an</h4><p>Private transfer from Xi'an Xianyang International Airport to your 5-star hotel. Evening welcome dinner at a renowned local restaurant featuring Shaanxi cuisine.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Xi'an 5★</span><span>🍽 Dinner</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>2</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Xi'an — Terracotta Warriors &amp; City Walls</h4><p>VIP early access to the Terracotta Warriors Museum before the crowds arrive. Afternoon bicycle ride along the ancient City Walls. Evening Tang Dynasty music and dance performance with dinner.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Xi'an 5★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>3</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Xi'an → Dunhuang (Flight)</h4><p>Morning flight to Dunhuang. Visit the Dunhuang Museum for an introduction to Silk Road history. Sunset at the Singing Sand Dunes with champagne.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Dunhuang 5★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>4</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Dunhuang — Mogao Caves VIP Experience</h4><p>Private guided tour of the Mogao Caves with an expert archaeologist, including exclusive access to specially preserved caves. Afternoon visit to a desert vineyard.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Dunhuang 5★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>5</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Dunhuang — Singing Sand Dunes &amp; Crescent Moon Spring</h4><p>Morning camel trek to Crescent Moon Spring. Afternoon at leisure with optional spa treatment at your hotel. Evening private stargazing experience in the Gobi Desert.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Dunhuang 5★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>6</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Dunhuang → Turpan (High-Speed Train)</h4><p>Business class high-speed train to Turpan. Visit the ancient Jiaohe Ruins with a private guide. Dinner at a traditional Uyghur courtyard restaurant.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Turpan 5★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>7</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Turpan — Silk Road Heritage</h4><p>Visit the Flaming Mountains, Grape Valley, and the Karez irrigation system. Exclusive behind-the-scenes visit to a traditional silk workshop. Wine tasting at a local vineyard.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Turpan 5★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>8</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Turpan → Urumqi</h4><p>Private transfer to Urumqi. Visit the Xinjiang Regional Museum and the Grand Bazaar. Farewell dinner at Urumqi's finest restaurant overlooking the city skyline.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Urumqi 5★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>9</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Depart Urumqi</h4><p>Private transfer to Urumqi Diwopu International Airport. Your luxury Silk Road journey concludes.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🍽 B</span></div></div></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What's Included</h2>
    <div class="inc-list">
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>8 nights 5-star hotel accommodation (twin-share)</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>Private English-speaking guide throughout</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>All domestic flights &amp; business class high-speed trains</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>Private luxury vehicle &amp; driver</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>All meals (B=Breakfast, L=Lunch, D=Dinner)</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>VIP access &amp; all entrance fees</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>Private airport transfers</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>Travel insurance (China domestic)</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item good"><span class="icon">✓</span><p>Welcome &amp; farewell gourmet dinners</p></div>
    </div>

    <h2>What's Excluded</h2>
    <div class="inc-list">
      <div class="inc-item bad"><span class="icon">✗</span><p>International flights to/from China</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item bad"><span class="icon">✗</span><p>Chinese visa fees</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item bad"><span class="icon">✗</span><p>Personal expenses &amp; tips</p></div>
      <div class="inc-item bad"><span class="icon">✗</span><p>Single room supplement ($580)</p></div>
    </div>

    


